#ASSERT `s 818(2) the appeal court is required to dismiss the application or allow it` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 818(2) the appeal court is required to dismiss the application or allow it` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 818(2)(b) the appeal court may allow the application, vacate the order made by the justice and make the order that it considers should have been made` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 818(2)(b) the appeal court may allow the application, vacate the order made by the justice and make the order that it considers should have been made` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 818(3) the order has the same force and effect as if it had been made by the justice` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 818(3) the order has the same force and effect as if it had been made by the justice` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
