#ASSERT `s 819(2) the appeal court is required to fix a date for the hearing and give directions for expediting it` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 819(2) the appeal court is required to fix a date for the hearing and give directions for expediting it` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
